  "contract": [
    "Selected interior contact supplies its object25 BYTE to the workspace visibility tag. Entry clears the tag. With inside-structure and object flag6, zero disables this filter; otherwise equal or +/-1 modulo256 passes the original BYTE SUB/NEG/CMP test. This is not a universal room identifier.",
    "Tunnel exit initializes the pitch-bias BYTE to102; its pose continuation sets the rotation0 accumulator1020. Later gated control steps subtract10/decrement while the accumulator is nonnegative; negative pitch cancels the bias. Not seconds or physical-frame timing.",
    "The player and other-object constraint paths choose paired X/Z offsets at either scale, indexed by object28 WORD*4. Original relevant interior placements supply0..5. Types66..70 initialize common contact flags, and type85 adds its original parameter26==4 variant before that common body; none changes28 in initialization.",
    "The four declared tables are exactly6 LONGs each. The following bytes remain unknown; no padding, sentinel or no-later-read claim. Generic object24/25/28 meanings remain polymorphic outside these consumers."
  ],
